}

docs {
  # Get Test Run

  Returns the full detail of a test run. Requires `test_run:read` permission and project
  membership (any role).

  - `200 OK` — test run detail
  - `403 Forbidden` — missing permission or not a project member
  - `404 Not Found` — not found or soft-deleted
}
